      "content": "the timer sounds okay, but i'm a bit worried about branding if people realize we actually have plenty in the warehouse. i think i saw a report that stock levels are actually pretty high for that model right now. is the scarcity play still worth it then? won't that backfire if we're lying about being low on stock?",
